        {
          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "The regulations of the Bureau under this subparagraph shall establish an effective date by which each nationwide specialty consumer reporting agency (as defined in section 1681a(w) 1 of this title) shall be required to comply with subsection (a), which effective date—"
        },
